TI  - Impact of Hospital Hierarchy on Nurses’ Attitudes Toward Artificial Intelligence: Mediating Roles of Artificial Intelligence Literacy and Anxiety
FAU - Xu D
FAU - Zheng Y
FAU - Yin Y
FAU - Lin C
