PMID- 38486010
TI  - Identification of kidney stones in KUB X-ray images using VGG16 empowered with explainable artificial intelligence
FAU - Ahmed F
FAU - Abbas S
FAU - Athar A
FAU - Shahzad T
FAU - Khan WA
FAU - Alharbi M
FAU - Khan MA
