PMID- 41597313
TI  - Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning in the Diagnosis and Management of Osteoporosis: A Comprehensive Review
FAU - Conforti A
FAU - Ruggiero M
FAU - Lucchetti L
FAU - Cipolloni V
