AB  - Artificial intelligence (AI) is providing opportunities to transform cardiovascular medicine. As the leading cause of morbidity and mortality worldwide, cardiovascular disease is prevalent across all populations, with clear benefit to operationalise clinical and biomedical data to improve workflow, quality of patient care, and lower costs. AI technologies are designed to aid accurate decisions, without the bias of external factors—a pitfall of human errors. However, AI algorithms are still subject to their own biases.
