PMID- 39934059
TI  - Generative Artificial Intelligence in Academic Surgery: Ethical Implications and Transformative Potential
FAU - Robinson JR
FAU - Stey A
FAU - Schneider DF
FAU - Kothari AN
FAU - Lindeman B
FAU - Kaafarani HM
FAU - Haines KL.
