PMID- 40903180
TI  - Artificial intelligence approach to optimise safety for hospitalised patients with dementia
FAU - Bangerter L
FAU - Fong A
FAU - Zabala G
FAU - Kim YK
FAU - Tabaie A
FAU - Werner NE
FAU - De Jonge KE
FAU - Ratwani RM.
