PMID- 42293622
TI  - Research integrity and data ethics in AI-driven integrated healthcare: a critical appraisal
FAU - Zeng W
FAU - Wei H
FAU - Chen Y
FAU - Tang J
FAU - Ge J
FAU - Chen H.
