TI  - FROM TEXT TO DIAGNOSE: CHATGPT’S EFFICACY IN MEDICAL DECISION-MAKING
FAU - Mykhalko Y
FAU - Kish P
FAU - Rubtsova Y
FAU - Kutsyn O
FAU - Koval V.
