TI  - Editorial: Progress and Prospects on Skin Imaging Technology, Teledermatology and Artificial Intelligence in Dermatology
FAU - Li C
FAU - Mun JH
FAU - Pasquali P
FAU - Li H
FAU - Soyer HP
FAU - Cui Y.
