TI  - The multiple uses of artificial intelligence in exercise programs: a narrative review
FAU - Canzone A
FAU - Belmonte G
FAU - Patti A
FAU - Vicari DSS
FAU - Rapisarda F
FAU - Giustino V
FAU - Drid P
FAU - Bianco A.
