TI  - Exploring prospects, hurdles, and road ahead for generative artificial intelligence in orthopedic education and training
FAU - Gupta N
FAU - Khatri K
FAU - Malik Y
FAU - Lakhani A
FAU - Kanwal A
FAU - Aggarwal S
