AB  - The role of AI in cardiovascular care. Artificial intelligence offers powerful tools to assist in the care of cardiac patients, but it remains to be seen if cardiologists will be replaced. Artificial intelligence can assist in medical education, automate image interpretation, and synthesize large quantities of data from a variety of sources. However, physician oversight is needed to ensure that reports generated are accurate, that bias is minimized, and the care provided is safe and inclusive.
