AB  - The aim of this article is to shed light on the evolving landscape of artificial intelligence (AI) integration in otolaryngology and its implications, particularly focusing on the ethical considerations surrounding AI applications, and to highlight the potential benefits of ChatGPT in patient management and scientific research within otolaryngology while emphasizing the necessity for ethical guidelines and validation processes. Ultimately, the article seeks to encourage a responsible and informed approach to AI adoption in otolaryngology, promoting collaboration between AI and healthcare professionals for the betterment of science and human well-being.
