PMID- 42516402
TI  - Engineering safety into AI-assisted music medicine for headache management: a transparent guardrail framework
FAU - Luo X
FAU - Pei Z
FAU - Yin AJ.
DP  - 2026
AID - 10.3389/fneur.2026.1870266 [doi]
AB  - While generative artificial intelligence enables large-scale, individualized, and digitally scalable interventions, its deployment introduces model instability and algorithmic reasoning errors. To ensure patient safety, the next frontier for AI-assisted music medicine therapeutics is not merely tool optimization, but the implementation of a transparent, rule-based clinical safety guardrail.
