PMID- 33937854
TI  - Magician’s Corner: 8: How to Connect an Artificial Intelligence Tool to PACS
FAU - Erickson BJ
FAU - Kitamura F.
DP  - 2021
AID - 10.1148/ryai.2021200105 [doi]
AB  - Authors show how to use Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine (DICOM) Query and Retrieve functions to pull a study from a cloud or public picture archiving and communication system (PACS), run an artificial intelligence (AI) algorithm on those images, and store the results back to another (cloud) PACS.
