PMID- 42444305
TI  - The complementary roles of oversight, education, and collaboration in the responsible integration of artificial intelligence in radiation medicine: White paper of CADRA
FAU - Gillan C
FAU - Liszewski B
FAU - Hsu A
FAU - Rahman F
