PMID- 39460097
TI  - Smart Vision Transparency: Efficient Ocular Disease Prediction Model Using Explainable Artificial Intelligence
FAU - Abbas S
FAU - Qaisar A
FAU - Farooq MS
FAU - Saleem M
FAU - Ahmad M
FAU - Khan MA.
