PMID- 37540463
TI  - Fairness of artificial intelligence in healthcare: review and recommendations
FAU - Ueda D
FAU - Kakinuma T
FAU - Fujita S
FAU - Kamagata K
FAU - Fushimi Y
FAU - Ito R
FAU - Matsui Y
FAU - Nozaki T
