TI  - Converging blockchain and next-generation artificial intelligence technologies to decentralize and accelerate biomedical research and healthcare
FAU - Mamoshina P
FAU - Ojomoko L
FAU - Yanovich Y
FAU - Ostrovski A
FAU - Botezatu A
