TI  - An artificial intelligence study: automatic description of anatomic landmarks on panoramic radiographs in the pediatric population
FAU - Bağ İ
FAU - Bilgir E
FAU - Bayrakdar İŞ
FAU - Baydar O
FAU - Atak FM
FAU - Çelik Ö
