PMID- 30950806
TI  - Artificial Intelligence in Clinical Health Care Applications: Viewpoint
FAU - van Hartskamp M
FAU - Consoli S
FAU - Verhaegh W
FAU - Petkovic M
FAU - van de Stolpe A.
