PMID- 38283483
TI  - Can Artificial Intelligence Replace the Unique Nursing Role?
FAU - Mohanasundari SK
FAU - Kalpana M
FAU - Madhusudhan U
FAU - Vasanthkumar K
FAU - B R
FAU - Singh R
FAU - Vashishtha N
