TI  - Quantifying Tropical Plant Diversity Requires an Integrated Technological Approach
FAU - Draper FC
FAU - Baker TR
FAU - Baraloto C
FAU - Chave J
FAU - Costa F
FAU - Martin RE
FAU - Pennington RT
FAU - Vicentini A
FAU - Asner GP.
