PMID- 42356169
TI  - Artificial Intelligence-Driven Fractional Flow Reserve Assessment: Technical Foundations, Clinical Insights, and Future Directions
FAU - Hafez A
FAU - Awad K
FAU - Farina JM
FAU - Nour M
