TI  - Augmenting community-driven vector surveillance with automated image classification: Lessons from the Artificial Intelligence Mosquito Alert (AIMA) system
FAU - Falk M
FAU - Garriga J
FAU - Eritja R
FAU - Sanpera-Calbet I
FAU - Pou E
FAU - Richter-Boix A
