TI  - Analyzing the Effectiveness of Macroeconomic Policies in Addressing Poverty in Iraq: An Econometric Study considering Digital Transformation and Artificial Intelligence for the Period (2004–2024)
FAU - Abdullah Abid Al Mihimdy N
