PMID- 41653831
TI  - Closing the loop: A systematic review of artificial intelligence in circular e-waste management
FAU - Jano T
FAU - Sayed AN
FAU - Hossen MM
FAU - Sardianos C
FAU - Hamila R
FAU - Bensaali F
FAU - Varlamis I
