TI  - Deploying artificial intelligence in the detection of adult appendicular and pelvic fractures in the Singapore emergency department after hours: efficacy, cost savings and non-monetary benefits
FAU - Quek JJX
FAU - Nickalls OJ
FAU - Wong BSS
