TI  - Explainable AI in radiology: a white paper of the Italian Society of Medical and Interventional Radiology
FAU - Neri E
FAU - Aghakhanyan G
FAU - Zerunian M
FAU - Gandolfo N
FAU - Grassi R
FAU - Miele V
