PMID- 35958422
TI  - Artificial intelligence applications in cardio-oncology: Leveraging high dimensional cardiovascular data
FAU - Chen H
FAU - Ouyang D
FAU - Baykaner T
FAU - Jamal F
FAU - Cheng P
FAU - Rhee JW.
