TI  - A Community-Based Usability Study of an AI-Enabled Oral Cancer Screening App Operated by Village Health Volunteers: Mixed Methods Study
FAU - Wongsapai M
FAU - Wudtijureepun K
FAU - Suthachai T
FAU - Tamdee D
FAU - Ittichaicharoen J
FAU - Wuttisarnwattana P
FAU - Suebnukarn S.
