TI  - The current status, knowledge, attitudes, and challenges of generative artificial intelligence use among undergraduate nursing students: a single-center cross-sectional survey of western China
FAU - Zhao Y
FAU - Yuan Y
FAU - Wen Z
FAU - Leng L
FAU - Shi L
FAU - Hu X
FAU - Wei X
FAU - Zuo M
FAU - Mou J
