PMID- 42123604
TI  - Next-Generation Artificial Intelligence Strategies for Mechanistic Cancer Target Discovery and Drug Development: A State-of-the-Art Review
FAU - Khan MS
FAU - Saeed M
FAU - Arham M
FAU - Zafar I
